  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/286903/Spheres-Apocrypha-Casting-Traditions-2?affiliate_id=549120\">Spheres Apocrypha: Casting Traditions 2</a></sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Mental Focus.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can expend your mental focus as part of casting a sphere effect to increase the saving throw DC by a +1 competence bonus. A sphere effect that does not require a saving throw to resist or lessen the effect cannot be used with this feat.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/drawback-feats#toc57\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
